    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562540/extras/e7aa500d9b9e2cf8423ec2d56bb555d4.avif?t=1747144840\" width=800 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the stage of <i>Forgetmenots</i>, a story-driven puzzle adventure where memories linger like echoes in an empty theater. In this beautifully crafted world, the entire game plays out like a theatrical performance, with shifting stage floors revealing new scenes as you progress through a sidescrolling journey of wonder, mystery, and melancholy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562540/extras/136a81763d48b7deb8ed151ea9164365.poster.avif?t=1747144840\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562540/extras/136a81763d48b7deb8ed151ea9164365.webm?t=1747144840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562540/extras/136a81763d48b7deb8ed151ea9164365.mp4?t=1747144840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a vibrant, whimsical aesthetic that contrasts its deeper themes, <i>Forgetmenots</i> tells a heartfelt story about loss and the fleeting nature of memories. Solve creative puzzles that bring the stage to life, uncover hidden moments from the past, and navigate a world where joy and sorrow dance together under the spotlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562540/extras/22dfaacc7b2d22457cd03d30e9964f86.poster.avif?t=1747144840\" width=800 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562540/extras/22dfaacc7b2d22457cd03d30e9964f86.webm?t=1747144840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562540/extras/22dfaacc7b2d22457cd03d30e9964f86.mp4?t=1747144840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D side-scrolling theatre</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the world in many different ways. Pick up and throw or push large objects in order to restore the memory to its correct state.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based puzzles and interactions create challenging environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore this thrilling stylized theater\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562540/extras/63a5c703c17aedb1ff6b876b85e8489b.poster.avif?t=1747144840\" width=462 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562540/extras/63a5c703c17aedb1ff6b876b85e8489b.webm?t=1747144840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562540/extras/63a5c703c17aedb1ff6b876b85e8489b.mp4?t=1747144840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Forgetmenots</i>\u00a0is a group project made by students. Expect a short yet thought-provoking game.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562540/extras/e7aa500d9b9e2cf8423ec2d56bb555d4.avif?t=1747144840\" width=800 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the stage of <i>Forgetmenots</i>, a story-driven puzzle adventure where memories linger like echoes in an empty theater. In this beautifully crafted world, the entire game plays out like a theatrical performance, with shifting stage floors revealing new scenes as you progress through a sidescrolling journey of wonder, mystery, and melancholy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562540/extras/136a81763d48b7deb8ed151ea9164365.poster.avif?t=1747144840\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562540/extras/136a81763d48b7deb8ed151ea9164365.webm?t=1747144840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562540/extras/136a81763d48b7deb8ed151ea9164365.mp4?t=1747144840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a vibrant, whimsical aesthetic that contrasts its deeper themes, <i>Forgetmenots</i> tells a heartfelt story about loss and the fleeting nature of memories. Solve creative puzzles that bring the stage to life, uncover hidden moments from the past, and navigate a world where joy and sorrow dance together under the spotlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562540/extras/22dfaacc7b2d22457cd03d30e9964f86.poster.avif?t=1747144840\" width=800 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562540/extras/22dfaacc7b2d22457cd03d30e9964f86.webm?t=1747144840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562540/extras/22dfaacc7b2d22457cd03d30e9964f86.mp4?t=1747144840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D side-scrolling theatre</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the world in many different ways. Pick up and throw or push large objects in order to restore the memory to its correct state.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based puzzles and interactions create challenging environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore this thrilling stylized theater\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562540/extras/63a5c703c17aedb1ff6b876b85e8489b.poster.avif?t=1747144840\" width=462 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562540/extras/63a5c703c17aedb1ff6b876b85e8489b.webm?t=1747144840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562540/extras/63a5c703c17aedb1ff6b876b85e8489b.mp4?t=1747144840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Forgetmenots</i>\u00a0is a group project made by students. Expect a short yet thought-provoking game.\u00a0</p>",
